      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu akajikwila mutaŋa waDavidi, niakwakushakama muYerusalema, kaseloki kakutookesha nachu nshidi namajilu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Dena ifuku odu mwituŋa nakajiyishamu majina awakishi akutuŋa, hiyakayanukaŋa nawa cheŋuku. Mwituŋa nakafumishamu nawa atuprofwetu nispiritu yamajilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akelaŋa chakelayi muntu nindi aprofweti, atata yindi namama yindi amusema akamwila nawu, Eyi hiwukuhandaku, muloŋa wudi nakuhosha yuma yakutwamba mwijina daYehova. Chakaprofwetayi tata yindi namama yindi amusema akamupwika zwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu atuprofwetu ejima chakaprofwetawu akatiya nsonyi yayimwenu yawu, iwu nachindi, iwu nachindi; hiyakavwala nawa mahina awuvuji kulonda kudimbana nachuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa yena wakela nindi, Ami hinikaprofwetuku, nidi mukwakudima kwami; ami kwami ankwata dehi wuduŋu kufuma kuwansi wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wumu wakamwihula nindi, Indi iyi yitu yidi mukachi kamakaseyi yanka? Yena wakaakula nindi, Yoyu yantapiluwu mwitala dawamabwambu jami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza nindi, Eyi mpoku yakabali, hindukaku namutulu wulwi nakabiŋa kami, wulwi namuntu mwinetu. Mutapi kabiŋa, nyikoku yipalaŋani ndundu; ninami nibalumuni chikasa chami hadi anyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova nindi, Mwituŋa dejima mwakela yibalu yiyedi akayifumishahu yakafwa, chamuchisatu chakashalamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chibalu chimu nakachihanwisha mukesi, nakayitookesha neyi chatookeshaŋawu siliva, nakayeseka neyi chesekaŋawu wuru. Akatambika ijina dami, ami nakayitiya. Nakela nami, Hiyantu ami; wena akela nawu, Yehova hiNzambi yami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
